# Traditional Chinese translation of LINE MR.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: lineMR 0.5.0\n"
"Language: zh_TW\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"

msgid "Reports whether the LINE MR accessibility bridge is installed and running in LINE and its call windows; pressed twice, copies a report for the developer"
msgstr "報告 LINE MR 無障礙橋接元件是否已安裝並在 LINE 及其通話視窗中執行;按兩次複製給開發者的報告"

msgid "Not available here. Switch to LINE's main window."
msgstr "此處無法使用。請切換到 LINE 的主視窗。"

msgid "Shows the friends list"
msgstr "顯示好友列表"

msgid "Shows the chat list"
msgstr "顯示聊天列表"

msgid "Shows add friends"
msgstr "顯示加入好友"

msgid "No list is shown."
msgstr "沒有顯示列表。"

msgid "Moves to the chat list or friend list"
msgstr "移到聊天列表或好友列表"

msgid "Moves to the chat list (switches to the chats tab first if needed)"
msgstr "移到聊天列表(如有需要先切換到聊天分頁)"

msgid "No search field is shown."
msgstr "沒有顯示搜尋欄位。"

msgid "Moves to the search field of the chat list or friend list"
msgstr "移到聊天列表或好友列表的搜尋欄位"

msgid "No chat is open."
msgstr "沒有開啟的聊天。"

msgid "Moves to the messages of the open chat"
msgstr "移到已開啟聊天的訊息"

msgid "Moves to the message input of the open chat"
msgstr "移到已開啟聊天的訊息輸入框"

msgid "Reads a recent message of the open chat: 1 is the newest, 9 the ninth newest"
msgstr "朗讀已開啟聊天的最近訊息:1 為最新,9 為倒數第九則"

msgid "LINE MR report copied to the clipboard."
msgstr "已將 LINE MR 報告複製到剪貼簿。"

msgid "No message {number}."
msgstr "沒有第 {number} 則訊息。"

msgid "LINE closed unexpectedly twice in a row, so LINE MR does not read message contents for now. Quit LINE normally and start it again to turn message reading back on."
msgstr "LINE 連續兩次意外關閉,因此 LINE MR 暫時不朗讀訊息內容。正常結束 LINE 後再啟動即可恢復朗讀訊息。"

msgid "LINE MR bridge installed. LINE is restarting."
msgstr "已安裝 LINE MR 橋接元件。LINE 正在重新啟動。"

msgid ""
"LINE has to be restarted to use LINE MR. Closing LINE's window does not quit LINE (it keeps running in the notification area).\n"
"Restart LINE now?"
msgstr ""
"需要重新啟動 LINE 才能使用 LINE MR。關閉 LINE 的視窗並不會結束 LINE(它會繼續在通知區域中執行)。\n"
"現在重新啟動 LINE 嗎?"

msgid "Calls: the bridge is running."
msgstr "通話:橋接元件正在執行。"

msgid "Calls: the bridge is installed."
msgstr "通話:已安裝橋接元件。"

msgid "Calls: the bridge is not loaded yet. Restart LINE to use LINE MR with calls."
msgstr "通話:橋接元件尚未載入。請重新啟動 LINE,以便在通話中使用 LINE MR。"

msgid "Calls: the bridge could not be installed."
msgstr "通話:無法安裝橋接元件。"

msgid "Calls: LINE has not set up calls yet."
msgstr "通話:LINE 尚未設定通話功能。"

msgid "LINE MR bridge is running."
msgstr "LINE MR 橋接元件正在執行。"

msgid "LINE MR bridge is installed, but LINE must be restarted to use it."
msgstr "LINE MR 橋接元件已安裝,但需要重新啟動 LINE 才能使用。"

msgid "LINE started without the LINE MR bridge. Windows or antivirus software is probably blocking it."
msgstr "LINE 啟動時沒有載入 LINE MR 橋接元件。可能被 Windows 或防毒軟體封鎖了。"

msgid "An older LINE MR bridge is installed in LINE."
msgstr "LINE 中安裝的是舊版 LINE MR 橋接元件。"

msgid "LINE MR bridge is not installed in LINE."
msgstr "LINE 中未安裝 LINE MR 橋接元件。"

msgid "This version of LINE is not supported by LINE MR. Update LINE to the latest version."
msgstr "LINE MR 不支援此版本的 LINE。請將 LINE 更新到最新版本。"

msgid "LINE for Windows was not found."
msgstr "找不到 LINE for Windows。"

msgid "This LINE MR package does not contain the bridge."
msgstr "此 LINE MR 套件不包含橋接元件。"

msgid ""
"LINE started without the LINE MR bridge ({path}). Antivirus software or a security policy may be blocking it: allow the file, then restart LINE.\n"
"To send a report to the developer, press NVDA+Shift+Control+L twice in LINE: it copies the report to the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"LINE 啟動時沒有載入 LINE MR 橋接元件 ({path})。可能被防毒軟體或安全性原則封鎖了:請允許該檔案,然後重新啟動 LINE。\n"
"如需向開發者傳送報告,請在 LINE 中按兩次 NVDA+Shift+Control+L,報告會複製到剪貼簿。"

msgid "LINE MR"
msgstr "LINE MR"

msgid "LINE is installed for all users. Windows will ask for permission to install the bridge."
msgstr "LINE 是為所有使用者安裝的。Windows 會要求安裝橋接元件的權限。"

msgid ""
"The LINE MR bridge was removed from LINE's folder, probably by antivirus software.\n"
"Allow {path} in your antivirus software, then press NVDA+Shift+Control+L in LINE to install it again."
msgstr ""
"LINE MR 橋接元件已從 LINE 的資料夾中被刪除,可能是防毒軟體所為。\n"
"請在防毒軟體中允許 {path},然後在 LINE 中按 NVDA+Shift+Control+L 重新安裝。"

msgid ""
"Windows Smart App Control is on. It blocks the LINE MR bridge ({path}), so LINE MR cannot work.\n"
"Smart App Control can be turned off in Windows Security, App & browser control (Windows cannot turn it on again without a reinstall)."
msgstr ""
"Windows 的智慧型應用程式控制已開啟,它會封鎖 LINE MR 橋接元件 ({path}),因此 LINE MR 無法運作。\n"
"可以在 Windows 安全性的「應用程式與瀏覽器控制」中關閉智慧型應用程式控制(關閉後除非重新安裝 Windows,否則無法再次開啟)。"

msgid ""
"Could not install the LINE MR bridge to {path}.\n"
"{error}"
msgstr ""
"無法將 LINE MR 橋接元件安裝到 {path}。\n"
"{error}"

msgid ""
"{reason}\n"
"\n"
"Install the bridge again and restart LINE?"
msgstr ""
"{reason}\n"
"\n"
"重新安裝橋接元件並重新啟動 LINE 嗎?"

msgid ""
"{status}\n"
"Install the LINE MR bridge now? LINE will be closed and started again."
msgstr ""
"{status}\n"
"現在安裝 LINE MR 橋接元件嗎?LINE 將關閉並重新啟動。"

msgid "LINE MR is not active for calls yet. Restart LINE after this call."
msgstr "LINE MR 尚未在通話中生效。請在本次通話結束後重新啟動 LINE。"

msgid "LINE MR is not active in LINE's photo and video viewer yet. Restart LINE to use it there."
msgstr "LINE MR 尚未在 LINE 的相片和影片檢視器中執行。請重新啟動 LINE 以在其中使用。"

msgid "Alt+A answers, Alt+D declines."
msgstr "Alt+A 接聽,Alt+D 拒絕。"

msgid "NVDA+Shift+Control+A answers, NVDA+Shift+Control+D declines."
msgstr "NVDA+Shift+Control+A 接聽,NVDA+Shift+Control+D 拒絕。"

msgid "Answers an incoming LINE call"
msgstr "接聽 LINE 來電"

msgid "Declines an incoming LINE call, or ends the current call"
msgstr "拒絕 LINE 來電,或結束目前的通話"

msgid "Answering"
msgstr "正在接聽"

msgid "Call declined"
msgstr "已拒絕來電"

msgid "Answers an incoming LINE call (from any application)"
msgstr "接聽 LINE 來電(在任何應用程式中)"

msgid "Declines an incoming LINE call (from any application), or ends the current call"
msgstr "拒絕 LINE 來電(在任何應用程式中),或結束目前的通話"

msgid "Call ended"
msgstr "已結束通話"

msgid "No LINE call."
msgstr "沒有 LINE 通話。"

msgid "No incoming LINE call."
msgstr "沒有 LINE 來電。"

msgid "LINE MR update"
msgstr "LINE MR 更新"

msgid "&Update now"
msgstr "立即更新(&U)"

msgid "&Later"
msgstr "稍後(&L)"

msgid "&Skip this version"
msgstr "略過此版本(&S)"

msgid "Checking for LINE MR updates"
msgstr "正在檢查 LINE MR 更新"

msgid "Checks for a newer version of LINE MR"
msgstr "檢查 LINE MR 的新版本"

msgid ""
"LINE MR {new} is available (installed: {old}).\n"
"\n"
"Update now? NVDA downloads and installs it, then asks to restart."
msgstr ""
"LINE MR {new} 已推出(已安裝:{old})。\n"
"\n"
"現在更新嗎?NVDA 會下載並安裝,然後要求重新啟動。"

msgid "Could not download the LINE MR update."
msgstr "無法下載 LINE MR 更新。"

msgid "Check for LINE MR &updates when NVDA starts"
msgstr "NVDA 啟動時檢查 LINE MR 更新(&U)"

msgid "&Check for updates now"
msgstr "立即檢查更新(&C)"

msgid "Could not check for LINE MR updates."
msgstr "無法檢查 LINE MR 更新。"

msgid "Downloading LINE MR {version}"
msgstr "正在下載 LINE MR {version}"

msgid "LINE MR {version} is up to date."
msgstr "LINE MR {version} 已是最新版本。"

msgid "No results"
msgstr "沒有搜尋結果"

msgid "Result {current} of {total}"
msgstr "第 {current} 個結果，共 {total} 個"

#. Translators: Button in the add-on's settings: shows what changed in each version.
msgid "&What's new"
msgstr "新功能(&W)"

#. Translators: Title of the window that lists what changed in each version of the add-on.
msgid "What's new in LINE MR"
msgstr "LINE MR 新功能"

#. Translators: Reported when the add-on's list of changes is missing.
msgid "The list of changes was not found."
msgstr "找不到變更列表。"
